status GREEN. The rows landed as %522 and %521 after FOUR renumbers across four fetches; the spine reads rebindings=0 next_free=523, unshared_citations=0, the ledger 1..522 gapless, both pins under bound, and the inherited CHECKPOINTS red closed upstream while this round ran -- readme_reach verdict=ok, broken_in_living=0. amphora_udp_reuseaddr 32/32, amphora_bounds_agree ok, reds-monotone 1..514 gapless, spine derive ok next_free=515, width-check, tame_style_check, exec-bit, index_row_bound and standing_equipment all green
recommend check in (either) -- the work is landed and green; the standing red wants its author, since repointing a peer's append-only checkpoint at one of three candidate shelves would resolve a link that should stay broken until someone who knows the fold repoints it.
